      '- **Flooring protection:** Depending on the existing floor finish, a base or load-distribution pad may be recommended.',
      '- **Relocation:** If the pod needs to be moved in future, disassembly and reassembly by the installer team is typically a separate cost.',
      '## Total cost of ownership',
      'Spread the total spend over the useful life of the pod to get a realistic annual cost. A pod that costs RM 18,800 and serves reliably for ten years costs less per year than a lower-priced equivalent that requires component replacement or fails acoustic performance after two.',
      'Compare models across price points at [office pod pricing](/pricing). If you are building a business case for director-level sign-off, Ace Pods provides written quotes with line-item pricing, warranty documentation, and purchase order support for corporate procurement teams.',
