      'Standard lead time is approximately 3 to 6 weeks after deposit confirmation. Installation is typically completed in one day by the Ace team. The same team handles post-installation checks and any warranty issues.',
      'Before installation, confirm with your building management: lift dimensions for pod delivery, loading bay access, and whether a temporary floor protection is required. Ace provides guidance on site access requirements as part of the project confirmation process.',
